# Grill — clickable multiple choice

When using **grilling**, **grill-me**, **grill-with-docs**, or `/grill`:

1. **MUST** use the Cursor **AskQuestion** tool (mouse-selectable options). Never ask for typed `"1"` / `"sim a todos"` when AskQuestion exists.
2. One AskQuestion call per round; one question per frontier decision; 2–4 options; recommended first (`(recomendado)` when helpful).
3. If AskQuestion is unavailable: one-line notice, try SwitchMode→Plan if it unlocks AskQuestion, then markdown fallback only.
4. Confirm shared understanding before implementing.

User-level rule + `~/.cursor/rules/grill-askquestion.mdc` also apply in every workspace.
